The final of the [[2026 AFA World Cup]] took place on 10 July 2026 at the [[Campo Simpliciano]] in [[Castejón]], contested between co-hosts [[Sanrobonia national football team|Sanrobonia]] and [[Asikyira national football team|Asikyira]].

